# mrfakename/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-abliterated (revision 517efab9, 2026-10-17): DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017
# with a refusal subspace projected out of attn.wo_b and ffn.shared_experts.w2 in the 40 main layers.
# Against 1017 (weights/manifest-1017abl-517efab9.tsv): shards 3-42 new (275.4 GiB), shards 1-2 and
# 43-48 byte-identical, Engram 47/48 included, so the 1017 slices serve it unchanged (ENGRAM_REVISION).
# Copy to cluster.1017abl.env (git-ignored); it reads cluster.env and changes only the weights and name.
# shellcheck source=/dev/null
source "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/cluster.env"
